    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a0f46de70c4ca2c7089d96bddd701be4.avif?t=1740168490\" data-has-big width=800 height=355 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/6b53b5a4c8f26ec9573a358b2af466d1.poster.avif?t=1740168490\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/6b53b5a4c8f26ec9573a358b2af466d1.webm?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/6b53b5a4c8f26ec9573a358b2af466d1.mp4?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Once upon a time, there was a magnificent kingdom that got cursed, and a prince turned into a frog. With art and animation from some of the talents behind Cuphead and the Rick &amp; Morty show, Croak is a fractured fairy tale with a cast of quirky, lovable characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Pure platformer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the SuperBonk ability: a deceptively simple moveset that allows him to use his tongue as a grapple to propel and bounce around levels. Make good use of the interactive platforming elements, sharp reflexes, and strategic thinking in order to make it through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/5c286658b0c9e0218aa00b6a486819c8.poster.avif?t=1740168490\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/5c286658b0c9e0218aa00b6a486819c8.webm?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/5c286658b0c9e0218aa00b6a486819c8.mp4?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff0 Reach your Castle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey will take you through various biomes, each with its own gameplay twist. Traverse swamps, haunted mines, snowy mountain ranges, and try to reach the cursed castle. Unlock secret areas, discover collectibles, face enemies and defeat bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a4a1895d0ae2ae4fdc59ce646c04dc95.poster.avif?t=1740168490\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a4a1895d0ae2ae4fdc59ce646c04dc95.webm?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a4a1895d0ae2ae4fdc59ce646c04dc95.mp4?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddd9 Lift the curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the prince get cursed? Unravel the mystery as you explore the kingdom: its subjects transformed into animals and the realm poisoned by deadly spiky vines. This fractured fairy tale, with beautiful hand-crafted visuals, will have you leaping to the challenge in search of your hoppily ever after. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord server, track the game development, chat with the devs and apply to Croak\u2019s insider program to access dev builds and impact production. Make your voice count and empower us to craft the best platformer ever. \ud83d\udc38<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/90d660d1d274eaae816e18038c317720.poster.avif?t=1740168490\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/90d660d1d274eaae816e18038c317720.webm?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a0f46de70c4ca2c7089d96bddd701be4.avif?t=1740168490\" data-has-big width=800 height=355 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/6b53b5a4c8f26ec9573a358b2af466d1.poster.avif?t=1740168490\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/6b53b5a4c8f26ec9573a358b2af466d1.webm?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/6b53b5a4c8f26ec9573a358b2af466d1.mp4?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Once upon a time, there was a magnificent kingdom that got cursed, and a prince turned into a frog. With art and animation from some of the talents behind Cuphead and the Rick &amp; Morty show, Croak is a fractured fairy tale with a cast of quirky, lovable characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Pure platformer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the SuperBonk ability: a deceptively simple moveset that allows him to use his tongue as a grapple to propel and bounce around levels. Make good use of the interactive platforming elements, sharp reflexes, and strategic thinking in order to make it through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/5c286658b0c9e0218aa00b6a486819c8.poster.avif?t=1740168490\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/5c286658b0c9e0218aa00b6a486819c8.webm?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/5c286658b0c9e0218aa00b6a486819c8.mp4?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff0 Reach your Castle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey will take you through various biomes, each with its own gameplay twist. Traverse swamps, haunted mines, snowy mountain ranges, and try to reach the cursed castle. Unlock secret areas, discover collectibles, face enemies and defeat bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a4a1895d0ae2ae4fdc59ce646c04dc95.poster.avif?t=1740168490\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a4a1895d0ae2ae4fdc59ce646c04dc95.webm?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/a4a1895d0ae2ae4fdc59ce646c04dc95.mp4?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddd9 Lift the curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the prince get cursed? Unravel the mystery as you explore the kingdom: its subjects transformed into animals and the realm poisoned by deadly spiky vines. This fractured fairy tale, with beautiful hand-crafted visuals, will have you leaping to the challenge in search of your hoppily ever after. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord server, track the game development, chat with the devs and apply to Croak\u2019s insider program to access dev builds and impact production. Make your voice count and empower us to craft the best platformer ever. \ud83d\udc38<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/90d660d1d274eaae816e18038c317720.poster.avif?t=1740168490\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616540/extras/90d660d1d274eaae816e18038c317720.webm?t=1740168490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Croak \ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udc51 is a nimble -and challenging- precision platformer featuring an innovative grapple mechanic. Use the frog\u2019s tongue to dash and bounce around through hundreds of hand-crafted rooms. Manipulate the environment as you traverse distinct biomes, each with unique gameplay mechanics and bosses.",
